## 📋 Refactoring Checklist

### For Every Component/Module:

- [ ] **Borders:** Change all `border-black` to `border-gray-900`, reduce thickness to 2px
- [ ] **Shadows:** Replace aggressive shadows with `shadow-[1px_1px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]` or `shadow-[2px_2px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]`
- [ ] **Colors:** Remove pure black (#000), use `text-gray-900`, `bg-white`, `bg-stone-50`
- [ ] **Typography:** Change `font-black` to `font-semibold` or `font-bold`, remove unnecessary `uppercase`
- [ ] **Rounded:** Add `rounded-lg` to all interactive elements
- [ ] **Spacing:** Ensure consistent padding (p-3, p-4, p-6) and gaps (gap-2, gap-3, gap-4)
- [ ] **Dividers:** Change table/list dividers from black to `gray-200`
- [ ] **Transitions:** Add `transition-all duration-150` or `transition-colors` to interactive elements
- [ ] **Hover States:** Implement subtle hover with background color change + shadow enhancement
- [ ] **Active States:** Use `bg-slate-600 text-white` for active/selected states
- [ ] **Badges:** Use colored backgrounds with matching text color (emerald, amber, blue, red)
- [ ] **Disabled State:** Use `opacity-50` and `disabled:cursor-not-allowed`

